     • strategy_four_volume.py  ← 监督器静默杀(>15min 无输出)
```
机制原文（`run_algorithms.py:873-885`）：
```python
SILENCE_KILL_SEC = int(_os.environ.get("V8_ALGO_SILENCE", "900"))
SILENCE_OVERRIDE = {
    "v8/factor_lab_gen.py": 3600,   # 2026-09-09 同型事故后加的
    "calc_crds.py": 1800,           # 2026-09-11 同型事故后加的
